<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Subscription Update - Censura</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #000000; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #ededed; }
    .wrapper { width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; background-color: #000000; padding: 60px 0; }
    .main { background-color: #111111; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 500px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #1a1a1a; }
    .content { padding: 48px; text-align: left; }
    .logo { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px; color: #ededed; text-decoration: none; }
    .header { margin-bottom: 40px; }
    h2 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; color: #ededed; margin: 0 0 16px 0; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
    p { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; color: #a1a1aa; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 24px 0; }
    .button-primary { display: inline-block; background-color: #282828; color: #ededed !important; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #000000; margin-right: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; transition: all 0.2s ease;}
    .button-primary:hover { background-color: #333333; cursor: pointer; }
    .button-secondary { display: inline-block; background-color: transparent; color: #ededed !important; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #1a1a1a; margin-bottom: 8px; transition: all 0.2s ease;}
    .button-secondary:hover { background-color: #1a1a1a; cursor: pointer; }
    hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a; margin: 40px 0 24px 0; }
    .footer { font-size: 13px; color: #71717a; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <table class="main" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
      <tr>
        <td class="content">
          <div class="header">
            <span class="logo">Censura</span>
          </div>
          <h2>You're halfway there</h2>
          <p>Hello <%= userName %>,</p>
          <p>We hope you are enjoying your <strong><%= plan %></strong> subscription on Censura.</p>
          <p>You are officially halfway through your active billing cycle. Just a friendly reminder that your current subscription period will end on <strong><%= endDate %></strong>.</p>
          <p>Make sure you catch up on the latest trending movies and series before your plan expires so you don't miss out.</p>
          
          <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
            <tr>
              <td>
                <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="button-primary">Go to Dashboard</a>
                <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="button-secondary">Visit Censura</a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          
          <hr />
          
          <div class="footer">
            &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Censura Inc. All rights reserved.<br>
            Please do not reply to this email.
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
